1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,441
A student gets an email about tuition.

2
00:00:03,481 --> 00:00:04,616
It looks official.

3
00:00:04,656 --> 00:00:07,518
But one detail is new: the bank account.

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,656
Would you pay this?

5
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:18,219
A university usually publishes one official
way to pay, such as its student portal.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,520
A message can quietly point to a
different account instead.

7
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:28,055
The request looks authentic,
but the money would go somewhere else.

8
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:36,352
In Indonesia, about two hundred
seventy-three UMTS students were reportedly

9
00:00:36,392 --> 00:00:40,194
affected in 2025,
according to campus reports.

10
00:00:40,294 --> 00:00:46,265
In Singapore, police reported at least twenty
education impersonation cases since

11
00:00:46,305 --> 00:00:47,371
March 2026.

12
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,878
And a payment slip is only a claim.

13
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,193
It shows what the sender says was sent.

14
00:00:53,233 --> 00:00:56,289
It does not show that
the university received it.

15
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:01,199
Only the institution's
own record can confirm payment.

16
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:06,734
CEKBAO checks the request
before the student pays.

17
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:11,603
It compares the message with evidence,
holds anything that does not match,

18
00:01:11,643 --> 00:01:14,014
and points to the official next step.

19
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,237
This is the real app, running
in a local sandbox.

20
00:01:20,277 --> 00:01:22,333
Ayu is a synthetic student.

21
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:27,867
She loads the urgent deposit email
and asks CEKBAO to check it.

22
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:31,056
The result is a conflict.

23
00:01:31,096 --> 00:01:35,755
Seven details do not match
the university's documented procedure.

24
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:40,735
The sender, the beneficiary and the
bank code all point away from the official

25
00:01:40,775 --> 00:01:41,418
record.

26
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:46,979
The payment is held, and
the sandbox payment plan is blocked.

27
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:52,479
The contact comes from the registry,
not from the suspicious message.

28
00:01:52,519 --> 00:01:54,834
The email is drafted, never sent.

29
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:59,992
Even a direct request to create a
plan is refused by the server.

30
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:03,888
Budi paid tuition through a
so-called bank agent.

31
00:02:03,928 --> 00:02:05,493
He checks three slips.

32
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:12,012
The bank feed and the university
ledger here are synthetic sandbox data.

33
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,703
One slip matches the institution ledger.

34
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:22,795
One has no bank transfer and
no university record.

35
00:02:22,835 --> 00:02:24,528
It stays unconfirmed.

36
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,163
One sent money to a personal account.

37
00:02:29,203 --> 00:02:30,584
That is a conflict.

38
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:36,380
A slip is not proof of settlement.

39
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:51,270
Citra's request matches the
synthetic registry.

40
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:55,501
That is a record comparison,
not a bank confirmation.

41
00:02:57,600 --> 00:03:00,066
She compares two illustrative quotes.

42
00:03:00,106 --> 00:03:04,555
CEKBAO computes the all-in cost with
exact decimal arithmetic.

43
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:08,555
She approves one sandbox plan, once.

44
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,682
The plan is not executed.

45
00:03:14,722 --> 00:03:16,006
No money moves.

46
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:27,346
Access control is enforced on the server.

47
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,714
Without a session, the request is rejected.

48
00:03:30,754 --> 00:03:33,595
A student cannot
open another student's case.

49
00:03:33,635 --> 00:03:36,703
An office reviewer cannot approve a payment.

50
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:41,062
Instructions hidden in a message
cannot override the decision.

51
00:03:41,102 --> 00:03:42,988
The payment stays on hold.

52
00:03:43,088 --> 00:03:47,357
The optional language model
was tested only with a mock provider.

53
00:03:47,457 --> 00:03:49,871
We re-ran the repository tests today.

54
00:03:49,911 --> 00:03:55,532
One hundred seventeen passed, and eighteen of
eighteen sandbox assertions passed.

55
00:03:55,632 --> 00:04:00,297
These are team-authored synthetic
cases, not an independent accuracy study.

56
00:04:00,337 --> 00:04:02,594
Nothing here connects to a bank.

57
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:07,648
CEKBAO, by HMIF, Institut Teknologi Bandung.

58
00:04:07,688 --> 00:04:09,157
Check the request.

59
00:04:09,197 --> 00:04:11,375
Use the official route.
